  "instructions": [
    "Heat the oven to 200C/180C fan/gas 6. Peel and roughly chop the onion, deseed and roughly chop the pepper, roughly chop the mushrooms, and drain and rinse the chickpeas.",
    "Tip the oil, onion, pepper, mushrooms, spices and salt into a large roasting tin, toss to coat and roast for 15 minutes.",
    "Stir in the chickpeas, tomatoes and cream and return to the oven for 40 to 45 minutes.",
    "Rest for 5 minutes, taste and adjust the salt. Serve with flatbreads or rice."
  ],
